.TH bap-inspect-proofs 1  "bap-inspect-proofs " 
.SH NAME
bap\-inspect\-proofs \- Report the proof evidence a TypeScript file produces
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbap\-inspect\-proofs\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report the proof evidence a TypeScript file produces
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print machine\-readable JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
Path to a TypeScript file
